'''Celestial''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Main Event for 98,000 [[Snow Tokens]]{{Currency|Snow Token|25px}} during the [[Christmas Event 2024|2024 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 
__NOTOC__
==Appearance==
It has a dark blue crescent moon-shaped chakram with small scattered golden stars, and a big star in the middle, hence its name. The handle is wrapped in a dark blue fabric with golden edges and two stars on each end.

==Trivia==
*It is the tenth ancient weapon to be obtained by purchasing the final tier in an event, the others being [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Logchopper]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Icebreaker]], [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Traveler's Axe]], [[Swirly Axe]], [[Gingerscope]], and [[Vampire's Axe]].
*It has a partner gun under the name [[Constellation]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Celestial Set|Celestial Set]].
*It partners with the effect under the same name [[Celestial Effect|Celestial]].
*It is the first [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife to not resemble an axe, scythe, or hammer but rather a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chakram chakram].
*Celestial was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*This item is confirmed to be a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chakram chakram], as the texture is named "chakramdev"<ref>https://create.roblox.com/store/asset/79010754957272?externalSource=www&assetType=Image</ref>
*There are [[Red Celestial|red]], [[Bronze Celestial|bronze]], [[Silver Celestial|silver]], and [[Gold Celestial|gold]] reskins of this weapon, they were given out to players on the top 100 leaderboard.

